/E (Hello, my name is Changyoon, and I am a first-year student in the INDiGO lab! Prior to joining Purdue's I/O program, I earned my MPS in I/O psychology at the University of Maryland, College Park, and my B.A. in psychology at the University of Minnesota, Twin Cities. My research interests include teams, leadership, and individual differences.)
