/E (Emma Showalter is a first year PhD student studying I-O Psychology at Purdue University. She received her B.S. in Psychology from Purdue in 2023 and went on to work in HR at Lincoln Financial for two years. She is broadly interested in studying how people actively shape their own growth and fulfillment, focusing on discernment, agency, and the practices that support a healthy relationship with work.)
